# 🎯 Think Like a Marketing Strategist: Grow This Brand
**Day 32/60 — #60DaysOfClaudeAI Challenge**
A single-file, offline-capable web app that teaches beginners how marketing *strategists think* — not just how to generate content.
## 🧠 Why This Exists
Marketing content generators are everywhere. Marketing *thinking* is rare — and it's the part that actually determines whether content works. Every section explains **What is this?** and **Why does it matter?** in plain language.
## ✨ Features
- **3 ways to start:**
  - 🏢 Use My Own Business
  - 🙋 Build My Personal Brand (your name, expertise & story as the "brand")
  - 🎲 A New Client Has Arrived (randomly generated business)
- **Audience deep-dive** with a strategist-style dossier card
- **Platform selection** with fit ratings (Great / Good / Situational / Weak) and reasoning for each
- **Content pillars** — choose exactly 3 from a curated set, each tied to a strategic goal
- **30-day roadmap** — weekly strategic focus, not a random post calendar
- **Unexpected plot twist event** (viral post, copycat, crisis) with branching consequences
- **Growth Report** — Audience Understanding, Platform Strategy, Content Strategy, Growth Potential, Best Decision, Biggest Mistake, 3 Marketing Lessons
- **"How to ask Claude" prompt cards** after every section — learn prompt engineering alongside marketing
- **Fully replayable** with new randomized businesses/personas every time
## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- Pure vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Zero frameworks, zero build tools, zero backend
- Single self-contained file — runs 100% offline
- Responsive, dark modern UI
## 🚀 How to Use
1. Download `marketing-strategist.html`
2. Open it in any browser
3. Pick a path and go through the full strategy simulation
